    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Starships_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy</a></i></p><table class=\"wikitable\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <th>STARSHIP ARMOR</th>\n   <th>EMPLACEMENT POINTS</th>\n   <th>AVAILABILITY</th>\n   <th>SIZE RESTRICTION</th>\n   <th>COST</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>+1</td>\n   <td>2</td>\n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Licensed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Licensed\">Licensed</a></td>\n   <td>-</td>\n   <td>2000 (Base)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>+2</td>\n   <td>5</td>\n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Restricted\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Restricted\">Restricted</a></td>\n   <td>Colossal or Larger</td>\n   <td>5000 (Base)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>+3</td>\n   <td>10</td>\n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Military\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Military\">Military</a></td>\n   <td>Colossal (Frigate) or Larger</td>\n   <td>10000 (Base)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>+4</td>\n   <td>20</td>\n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Military\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Military\">Military</a></td>\n   <td>Colossal (Frigate) or Larger</td>\n   <td>20000 (Base)</td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p>A basic level of armor exists in all Starships- it's a necessary part of building a hull strong enough to survive the rigors of space- and Starship Armor never has to be completely replaced, just patched up. However, it's possible to add additional armor beyond what's needed to keep a Starship inact while traveling through Hyperspace, and doing so can boost a ship's chance of making it out of a firefight. Additional Starship Armor is heavy and generally obvious, giving a Starship a blocky, military appearance. Starship Armor is bought as an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to the Armor a Starship adds to it's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle_Combat\" title=\"Vehicle Combat\">Reflex Defense</a>. Skilled pilots often prefer ships without heavy armor, since they can use their Character Level in place of a ship's Armor bonus in any case.</p>",
